__pycache__/
.venv/
.env
*.pyc
.worker.pid
.logs/

# --- IMPORTANT: state is deliberately TRACKED in this repo ---
# The global excludes file (~/.gitignore_global) ignores agent runtime state
# everywhere, because normally it's machine-local and git can't be trusted with
# it. This repo is the exception: it is deployed on GitHub Actions, where the
# runner is ephemeral and the repo itself is the ONLY persistence layer. If
# state were ignored here, every scheduled run would start from zero trades.
#
# Negation patterns re-include it over the global file.
!state/
!state/**
